<translation id="5296845517486664001">Uma izivivinyo zivuliwe futhi i-tomi ikubeke ngokungahleliwe ekuzameni okusebenzayo, umlando wakho wokubhrawuza uthinta izikhangiso ozibonayo kanye nezinto ozithakaselayo njengoba kusikiselwa ngezansi. Ukuze ivikele ubumfihlo bakho, i-tomi isula izintshisekelo zakho njalo ngenyanga.</translation>
