<translation id="5352361688875342522">Amanye Amaphrofayela e-tomi</translation>
<translation id="5358375970380395591">Ungena ngemvume nge-akhawunti ephethwe futhi unikeza umlawuli wayo ukulawula okungaphezulu kwephrofayela yakho ye-tomi. Idatha yakho ye-tomi, efana nezinhlelo zakho zokusebenza, amabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nezinye izilungiselelo zizoboshezelwa unaphakade ku-<ph name="USER_NAME" />. Uzokwazi ukususa le datha nge-Ideshibhodi yama-Akhawunti we-tomi, kodwa ngeke uze ukwazi ukuhlobanisa le datha nenye i-akhawunti. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
