<translation id="6443470774889161065">I-tomi ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi engeziwe ongase uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha kakhudlwana lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="645458117210240797">Kuvaliwe • I-tomi ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivela kuphi</translation>
