<translation id="6669284030132180248">Uma futhi ulondoloza amabhukhimakhi ku-tomi Account yakho, ungakwazi ukulandelela izintengo zomkhiqizo ku-tomi futhi waziswe uma intengo yehla.</translation>
<translation id="6676384891291319759">Finyelela i-inthanethi?</translation>
<translation id="668175097507315160">I-tomiOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho yenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="6692797197837897398">I-tomi ikunikeza ukulawula okwengeziwe ezikhangisweni ozibonayo futhi ikhawulela lokho amasayithi angakufunda ngawe uma ekubonisa izikhangiso eziqondene nawe</translation>
