Ezinye izici kungenzeka zingatholakali. Sicela ucacise umkhombandlela wephrofayela ehlukile noma usebenzise inguqulo entsha ye-tomi.</translation>
<translation id="6729124504294600478">Ukuze uthole ukwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye nezinye izakhi, ezifaka i-tomi Kumsebenzi wewebhu nowe-app nakumasevisi alinkiwe e-tomi</translation>
<translation id="6734291798041940871">I-tomi isivele ifakiwe kubo bonke abasebenzisi kukhompuyutha yakho.</translation>
<translation id="673636774878526923">Ukuze ufinyelele ezintweni zakho ze-tomi kuwo wonke amadivayisi wakho, ngena ngemvume, bese uvula ukuvumelanisa.</translation>
<translation id="674245979920622322">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. I-tomi isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, <ph name="PERMISSION_2" />, nokungu-<ph name="COUNT" /> ngaphezulu</translation>
