<translation id="6873893289264747459">I-tomi ithole ukuthi i-"<ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" />" inohlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha</translation>
<translation id="6929417474050522668">Lapho imizamo ivuliwe, Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sivumela amasayithi owavakashelayo ukuba acele ulwazi ku-tomi olusiza isayithi ukukala ukusebenza kwezikhangiso zawo. Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sikhawulela ukulandelela indawo yonke ngokudlulisa ulwazi oluncane ngangokunokwenzeka phakathi kwamasayithi.</translation>
<translation id="6940431691900807093">Kamuva, isayithi olivakashelayo lingacela i-tomi ukuthi ibone izintshisekelo zakho ukuze yenze izikhangiso ozibonayo ngokwezifiso zakho. I-tomi ikwazi ukwabelana ngezintshisekelo ezifika ku-3.</translation>
