<translation id="6978145336957848883">Amaphasiwedi angaqinile aqageleka kalula. Vumela i-tomi <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />ikudalele futhi ikhumbule amaphasiwedi aqinile<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="6981396265751285733">Uma ivuliwe, i-tomi ikhulula inkumbulo kumathebhu angasebenzi. Lokhu kunikeza amathebhu asebenzayo namanye ama-app izinsiza zekhompyutha ezengeziwe futhi kugcina i-tomi ishesha. Amathebhu akho angasebenzi aphinde asebenze ngokuzenzakalelayo uma ubuyela kuwo.</translation>
